{#-
  Agent Autopsy — Extended Report Template
  Version: 2.0.0

  Concise, header-driven sections inferred from Langfuse traces.
  Shared structure for passed/failed reports. Failed reports add error detail.

  Template variables (provided by report_generator.py):
    - trace_id, workflow_name, severity_label, confidence, total_spans
    - total_failures, business_impact, issues_at_glance, issues, minor_issues
    - root_causes, has_compound_failure, compound_failure_text
    - recommended_actions, observability_action
    - NEW: execution_context, outcome_summary, timeline, state_evolution
    - NEW: decisions, tools_summary, retries, performance, classification
    - NEW: causal_sequence, metadata_summary, error_summary
    - NEW: user_question, tool_calls, planner_decision, execution_tree
-#}
